Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Arrow_Ice/z_arrow_ice.c.

Provenance comments accompany the definition and every header declaration,
so the name can be re-derived or overturned later. See
tasks/reference/ocarina/decomp-renaming.md.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Arrow_Ice/z_arrow_ice.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Arrow_Ice/z_arrow_ice.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Arrow_Ice/z_arrow_ice.c
index 42fe9d3d9..8be0c49b8 100644
